label start

# backgrounds
set black_screen "res://example_assets/black_screen.png"

background black_screen

speaker _

	Hello! This is the second example dialog.
	It shows how you can jump to another dialog and then return to the previous one.

choose
	Jump to another dialog! -> jump_to_other_dialog
	Continue with this dialog! -> continue_dialog

label jump_to_other_dialog

	You will now jump to another dialog. After that dialog ends, you will return to this one.

dialog example_dialog_3

	The other dialog just finished, and now we're back here!

jump end

label continue_dialog

	You chose to continue with this dialog!
	Sadly there's nothing else to show here, so let's just end the dialog.

jump end

label end

speaker _

	That's the end of the second example dialog. Thanks for watching!

hide_dialog

background none

wait 1.0
